 cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ combat-altering spicy status effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 main attribute skill trees with cards and additional perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 streamlined archetypes and dozens of sub-playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473260/extras/602b18a56e30dce91804b96ca74a480b.poster.avif?t=1782812537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473260/extras/602b18a56e30dce91804b96ca74a480b.webm?t=1782812537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473260/extras/602b18a56e30dce91804b96ca74a480b.mp4?t=1782812537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Class Every Run </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of 5 fantasy races with their own starter decks and attribute bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spice things up with 11 character backgrounds, each granting you a special card and an extra attribute modifier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for loot, XP, renown, and level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new cards based on your attributes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473260/extras/5510a7fb0999fdc57ebda57ba046aa6f.poster.avif?t=1782812537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473260/extras/5510a7fb0999fdc57ebda57ba046aa6f.webm?t=1782812537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\